add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add set ip ferm badguys { type ipv4_addr; size 65535; flags dynamic,timeout; }
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT ip saddr @badguys drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp dport 2222 add @badguys { ip saddr timeout 1h }
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp dport 2223 update @badguys { ip saddr }
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp dport 2224 delete @badguys { ip saddr }
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp option maxseg size 1400-1500 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp option maxseg size != 536 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp option timestamp exists accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp option md5sig missing accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT tcp option 254 exists tcp option maxseg size 536 drop
